flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#1d2029,stroke:#555b68,color:#eceef1;
  classDef friction fill:#262a34,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:2px,color:#eceef1;
  classDef broken fill:#1d2029,stroke:#d77757,stroke-width:2px,color:#d77757;
  S1["1. Nudges are on by default; permission is asked<br/>at launch.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S2["2. The weekly passes 80% while a session feeds:<br/>'Weekly at 80%' with the countdown and the<br/>landing time, once per weekly window.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. 15 minutes before the 5h reset: '5h window ends<br/>in 15 min' with the percentage, once per<br/>window.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. Ultra: the frozen 5h record can still pass that<br/>test once, and announce the end of a window the<br/>plan no longer has.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S5["5. Notifications denied: the Nudge row says<br/>'Notifications are off for this app in System'<br/>and stops at the edge; it does not open System<br/>Settings.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S6["6. No nudge comes from stale figures: an hour<br/>without a session and the nudges wait.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
